            <a href="Pull-Request-Details.topic" type="cross-check"
               summary="Read the timeline, check policies and review changed files">Review a pull request</a>
            <a href="Azd-PR-Complete.topic" type="turn-on"
               summary="Vote, set auto-complete and merge a pull request">Vote, complete and merge</a>
            <a href="Azure-DevOps-Pipelines.topic" type="cloud"
